COMP2404 Assignment 2 - Telco Message Manager

Author
Jackson Lafrance

Purpose
This program manages subscribers and their incoming and outgoing text messages for a telephone company.

Source Files
Control.cc     Implements the Control class
Date.cc        Implements the Date class
Msg.cc         Implements the Msg class
MsgArray.cc    Implements the MsgArray class
Subscriber.cc  Implements the Subscriber class
Telco.cc       Implements the Telco class
Time.cc        Implements the Time class
View.cc        Implements the View class
main.cc        Implements the main control flow and the provided sorting stuff

Header Files
Control.h     Declares the Control class
Date.h        Declares the Date class
Msg.h         Declares the Msg class
MsgArray.h    Declares the MsgArray class
Subscriber.h Declares the Subscriber class
Telco.h       Declares the Telco class
Time.h        Declares the Time class
View.h        Declares the View class
defs.h        Declares all the constants and enum stuff

Other Files
Makefile compiles and links the program and provides the clean and also Readme is this one

Data Files
None

Compilation
In the directory containing the program files, run:

    make

Launching
Run the program with:

    ./a2

Cleaning
To remove the .o files and a2, run:

    make clean
